    {
      "id": "16502511-f625-4a95-b75b-9e14b537d3b0",
      "rule_id": "sod1820_canonical_identity_law",
      "rule_version": 5,
      "description": "Human-Gate ZURIEL 17.9.2026. EXTEND_EXISTING only under SOD1820_DESIGN_CONTRACT_V1.md. v3 preserves v2 identity/mark/expression/lens/color decisions and locks the second Brand Core layer across site, World, Heichal, Raziel, posts, Share Cards, AI image/video generation, Remotion and future projections. TYPOGRAPHY: the protected Hebrew heritage wordmark «כי לה׳ המלוכה» is artwork, not live font text, and must not be retyped/redrawn in branded lockups. Live typography consumes existing semantic roles F.ui / F.body / F.display / F.numeric and existing type scale; no new brand-font owner. MOTION: brand artwork may translate, scale, fade, reveal, receive restrained glow/light sweep/depth/orbit context, but must not morph, redraw, distort or regenerate. Motion meaning is canonical; exact duration/composition is surface projection. Consume existing designTokens.MOTION and reduced-motion behavior; Remotion maps the same tokens to frames, not a separate motion system. AI BRAND CONTEXT: every SOD1820 branded generation derives from this canonical identity, mark, expressions by locale, color-role ownership, typography roles, voice/truth constraints, environment role and safe-area requirement. Generative AI creates scene/environment candidates, not the Master Mark or protected Hebrew wordmark. Canonical brand assets are composited as exact overlays after generation. SAFE AREAS: every branded representation reserves a brand-safe/focal region that survives target crop; exact coordinates vary by aspect/surface and are projection. Required brand text is not baked into generated backgrounds. REQUIRED ASSET PACK: one canonical Master Crown transparent asset; one protected Hebrew heritage wordmark transparent asset; one Hebrew master lockup Crown+wordmark; one icon/crown crop; asset metadata including dimensions/checksum/clear-space. KINGDOM RISE, SOD1820, URL and content titles remain live typography by default unless a separately approved exact artwork asset exists. CANONICAL = identity, protected artwork, expression mapping, semantic typography roles, motion semantics, AI brand-generation constraints, safe-area principle and required asset identities. PROJECTION = size, placement, crop/aspect, exact timing, scene/background, density, optional expression/URL/title and safe-area coordinates. No Brand System/Store/Registry, no motion engine, no media registry, no palette owner and no video-specific brand system are created.\n\n[UPDATE v4 · Human-Gate ZURIEL · 17.9.2026 — EXPERIENCE PROJECTION MATRIX · EXTEND_EXISTING]\nBRAND CORE IS RENDERER-AGNOSTIC. The canonical SOD1820 context is composed once and consumed by Web/UI, interactive motion, Canvas, GPU 3D, AI image/video generation, Share Cards, Remotion, audio/narration and future XR. There is no separate image/video/3D/audio brand.\nEvery renderer resolves, as applicable: canonical identity; Master Mark; protected Hebrew wordmark; locale/public expression; color roles; typography roles; surface voice role; motion vocabulary; spatial tier; voice mode; caption mode; environment role; AI visual freedom; safe area; truth-safe constraints; and performance/accessibility fallback.\nAI may generate environment/scene/atmosphere/spatial candidates but never regenerate the protected Master Crown or Hebrew wordmark and never bake required brand text into uncontrolled pixels. Canonical artwork is composited deterministically.\nCANONICAL = identity/artwork, semantic color and typography roles, voice character, motion vocabulary, spatial/audio invariants, AI constraints, safe-area principle and fallback semantics. PROJECTION = renderer, spatial tier, exact TTS provider/model, timing/easing/camera/lighting/material/fog/particles/audio mix/layout/crop and optional title/URL/expression.\nOWNER CHECK: Brand stays under the Design Contract / this identity law; Experience v5 owns contextual audio-motion-spatial behavior; Raziel and Publishing keep their existing voice owners. One composed runtime context, no new store/registry/system.\n\n[UPDATE v5 · Human-Gate ZURIEL · 1.10.2026 — PRIMARY LOCKUP FINALIZATION]\nThe Primary SOD1820 logo is one inseparable protected artwork lockup: approved crown + exact Hebrew wordmark «כי לה׳ המלוכה». Crown-only is forbidden on every branded surface, including small marks and video watermarks. The former icon_crown_crop requirement is superseded and removed. No English wording is part of the logo. For authored Hebrew video, the full lockup is used throughout; only in intro/outro may the separate live-text domain «sod1820.co.il» be added as supporting information. KINGDOM RISE may remain historical/optional English-language copy outside the logo when a separately governed English surface needs it, but it is never part of the canonical logo and is not used in the Hebrew video lockup.\n",
